    <bpmn2:task id="task_HqPcuw" imixs:processid="1031" name="AI Assist Payment">
      <bpmn2:extensionElements>
        <imixs:item name="txtworkflowsummary" type="xs:string">
          <imixs:value><![CDATA[<itemvalue>id</itemvalue> <itemvalue>transferred.payment.currency</itemvalue> <itemvalue>transferred.payment.amount</itemvalue>]]></imixs:value>
        </imixs:item>
        <imixs:item name="txtworkflowabstract" type="xs:string">
          <imixs:value><![CDATA[Fine Details:
Fine Id : <itemvalue>fine.id</itemvalue>

Vehicle Details:
Vehicle Plate Number :<itemvalue>fine.plate.number</itemvalue>,
Vehicle Name: <itemvalue>fine.vehicle.name</itemvalue>

Payment Details:
Reference number: <itemvalue>payment.reference.number</itemvalue>]]></imixs:value>
        </imixs:item>
      </bpmn2:extensionElements>
      <bpmn2:documentation id="documentation_jjL5jg">AI identifies the Rental contract by matching the vehicle number plate.</bpmn2:documentation>
      <bpmn2:outgoing>sequenceFlow_0eV0wg</bpmn2:outgoing>
      <bpmn2:outgoing>sequenceFlow_c9rWxg</bpmn2:outgoing>
    </bpmn2:task>
    <bpmn2:dataObject id="dataObject_xigrew" imixs:datatype="prompt-data" name="Payment Agent">
      <bpmn2:documentation id="documentation_0idvzQ"><![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<PromptDefinition> 
  <options>{"n_predict": 4096, "temperature": 0 }</options>
  <tools>update_workitem,link_workitem,task_complete</tools>
  <prompt role="system"><![CDATA[
You are a car rental manager. A new fine has been payed.

Use the tool call "link_workitem" to search for the matching
fine request and link it to the current workitem in one step. Pass the transferred payment reference number (id) 
as the value for the index field "id", and the fixed value "Fine Management" for the index field "$workflowgroup" inside the criteria parameter. 
Also pass "fine.ref" as the refField parameter, so the link is additionally stored in that field.
Example: {"criteria": {"id": "6014343867243", "$workflowgroup": "Fine Management"}, "refField": "fine.ref"}

If link_workitem reports exactly one linked match (linkedCount: 1), call task_complete with
a short one-sentence summary of the result parameter.

If link_workitem reports zero or more than one linked match, do not call task_complete.
Instead respond with a short plain-text note stating how many contracts were found and
that a manager needs to review the case.
]]]]><![CDATA[>
</prompt>
<prompt role="user"><itemvalue>payment.summary</itemvalue></prompt>
</PromptDefinition>]]></bpmn2:documentation>
    </bpmn2:dataObject>
